OL,3,GNEWSABlack patients 'let down' by
OL,4,Acancer care - study
OL,5,
OL,6,FBreast cancer care is "falling short"
OL,7,Ffor black patients and people with
OL,8,Flearning disabilities, a study has
OL,9,Ffound.
OL,11,FThe research, led by the University of
OL,12,FSurrey, discovered that these two
OL,13,Fgroups face longer waiting times at
OL,14,F"key stages" of their care.
OL,16,F"Our study shows that the country
OL,17,Fcurrently has a system that is letting
OL,18,Fdown the patients who already face the
OL,19,Fmost barriers," said associate
OL,20,Fprofessor Dr Robert Kerrison.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
