OL,3,GNEWSABlack patients 'let down' by
OL,4,Acancer care - study
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe study - which looked at more than
OL,7,F86,000 patients' medical records -
OL,8,Ffound black patients had 29 per cent
OL,9,Flower odds of being diagnosed through
OL,10,Froutine breast screening.
